msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_260F0301_C684_4150_A887_524181C4FBA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9af3bd73ee75b9a66cafe8c422fea454ed3799f4fc020c6a775d57ff38a77f7
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_260F0301_C684_4150_A887_524181C4FBA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9BDA91B8_539C_4F5D_847A_7DA133F4322E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3dc64abbcbaf82506ed864569f248b9562b3719f693b15475b242eec4b4bde1
#. default-sha256: 12c5c658a4676a11de2fdbcf51128f8cbb37311544fa72ac53b1a88f0ab68d76
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9BDA91B8_539C_4F5D_847A_7DA133F4322E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her response perplexed me to no end."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……正直、⟪k:1⟫不思議でならなかった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EC49C8BB_5FDB_4AE8_9EBB_AA9063A1CF4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67b9064368c26db344637f207b1b554bd5ad05053b576c7b35d3ce75c4d1cb42
#. default-sha256: afa2394a2eb9681239fc44d83df7cb7ee253e4e23fa9315279783c9ecd428583
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EC49C8BB_5FDB_4AE8_9EBB_AA9063A1CF4E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why was she concerned about showing gratitude?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why was she not despairing of her "
"own circumstances?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫なぜここで、⟪k:1⟫他人に対する礼が出てくる？⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫なぜ自分の境遇を嘆かない？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_588F204E_BD55_492F_AE46_FEE88E4B0992
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9858f142c9a0e004f36d85d1624aa979e7c0caedf068b89439a6e60f3fb7e507
#. default-sha256: 8d4b0006fc78a0b9f7843e28c9b3d255fbbea56de8f060f16f00f491ae6b3439
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_588F204E_BD55_492F_AE46_FEE88E4B0992"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why was ⟪k:1⟫that⟪k:2⟫ the emotion that gripped her in that moment,⟪k:3⟫not hatred for the "
"slave trader or sorrow for herself?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫奴隷商を憎むでもなく、⟪k:1⟫自分を哀れむのでもなく……、⟪k:2⟫なぜ礼を言えなかったことで泣く？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E741F2EC_7327_47BE_A7F8_6829F55F4BD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fce0eabfd1e760db98a6ddf1a81b8bc303401b1099f678b31268bd201115b75
#. default-sha256: c19660d0047f5591eb9cc0a0c12fe5cfbc326a22dcbe894794a58214d48db7b3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E741F2EC_7327_47BE_A7F8_6829F55F4BD7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that wasn’t the only thing I found curious—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……不思議だったのは、⟪k:1⟫その娘の言葉だけでなく……声もだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5208504F_1AAE_4F72_B6CB_E7190415914C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06eb3993b28696f8f94ac04ab5f5650728291f73748ee961bfd1ac887c4a78e3
#. default-sha256: 7fba55199ce82040c9cad19fab391209bfb6f9d590f6214d9c8c9f660db188b0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5208504F_1AAE_4F72_B6CB_E7190415914C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫untainted by its surroundings, gently undulating."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それは何とも交わらず、⟪k:1⟫何にも侵食されず、⟪k:2⟫ゆっくりと揺れている。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E504084A_9C20_45F3_912C_A7D0B10F5E4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd58e508c5fcaf64f2ab1c737aa82dbeda2a9fc3eccc3d01dae02885eab2eecc
#. default-sha256: 8fd9649623594a7fa77db43e9d75e1d75aec522c7eca4d9e788f7943d255c2c7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E504084A_9C20_45F3_912C_A7D0B10F5E4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One sentence was all she said, but there was something unbelievably calming about the sound "
"of it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫少女が発したのはその言葉だけだったが、⟪k:1⟫それは驚くほどに俺の心を安らかにしていった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B8A4CC39_B636_4246_8280_80E8593A0BC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 858b42c4f71cd97bd7bf0e8ed61ff032ce62b8659f44b6bd7ddf071c18a80f58
#. default-sha256: f66383c1d9182566d73b28df7ceacb449d97887218a257852e96fb39876adf3a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B8A4CC39_B636_4246_8280_80E8593A0BC9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wanted to get her out of that filthy carriage,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to undo the shackles threatening "
"to taint her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そいつを……この汚らしい馬車から出してやろうと思って……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫その穢れた枷を外してやろうと"
"思って……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A6C67B8C_AC73_47DE_B7BA_2A35F735CC4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8b1c54813897ee12af1b330b5685a373fb281fb2f75754f22fb1ed7b733496a
#. default-sha256: 1e2917f6694f4fd551e1e2cd8371083042de01c72f45195adddec5ded6f167ed
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A6C67B8C_AC73_47DE_B7BA_2A35F735CC4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please! Y-⟪k:1⟫You can have all my money!⟪k:2⟫You can go free, if that’s what you want!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫頼む……！　⟪k:1⟫か、⟪k:2⟫金なら渡してやる……！　⟪k:3⟫お前に自由だって渡してやろう！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E9304167_6DA8_4048_B3A9_C40F51B84193
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9af3bd73ee75b9a66cafe8c422fea454ed3799f4fc020c6a775d57ff38a77f7
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E9304167_6DA8_4048_B3A9_C40F51B84193"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7DBA9456_045C_4B81_80D9_855C84B146AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1543b83bade97207c26916324aef89044d47bda2c024ef1a3d76005ac640f67
#. default-sha256: fd9b6a5641267c071116b712f500e1acd8ec8e2aeb454a4e52b51930104c4a50
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7DBA9456_045C_4B81_80D9_855C84B146AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What... ⟪k:1⟫Why are you laughing?!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Please spare me!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫おい……、⟪k:1⟫おい、⟪k:2⟫何を笑っているんだ……！⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫頼む、⟪k:5⟫見逃してくれよ……！！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_356BBD69_CC39_40EF_B716_3DC3E83C717F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38b3ba2e54b630b698b4cba68fddc6beef0300f776fc03d75c6b1ebdfd8b7cfe
#. default-sha256: ed751e48ab26c849082898763bfea13acdbeff9a87edde6a732de2a8f604e948
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_356BBD69_CC39_40EF_B716_3DC3E83C717F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And why—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫                                             ⟪k:7⟫"
"should I care?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それが―――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　　　　　　　　どうしたって？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_47E25499_1CB1_4FCD_812C_5E2E7E83CFEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38f2e8d1c1fa5a46b82e858a7beb5bf3281d036fa5a9c81d368b076c3ae28e18
#. default-sha256: 164745963c1f15690ee56b7ad15f129aa4ae58aa373f5a0479f85a9f6200ad1e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_47E25499_1CB1_4FCD_812C_5E2E7E83CFEF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Look at this..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫おい……、⟪k:1⟫見ろよ………。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7A46B2FE_18AB_4BAF_89BD_43662D335722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6918c815882cfd359e9b83f169e39c789fbae1bcb2fffea42a1b3713c74b91b
#. default-sha256: 119bdd9237c115ee5b44ef625e4b6fc545e1f2139078cf635567df42b2517b3d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7A46B2FE_18AB_4BAF_89BD_43662D335722"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They stood no chance against my strength!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫俺の力の前に……、⟪k:1⟫奴らは屈服するしかなかったのだ……！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B7204B16_FEB5_4ED8_9B3C_52F11A5F5D88
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f677f46790d590207f6f19b663b5bc19aa0f0a45d9822078faf77691d0c46c1
#. default-sha256: 7e6a921f3671b7b13d556ca794212c550a0518877e17522b3b144c9a39eb51b4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B7204B16_FEB5_4ED8_9B3C_52F11A5F5D88"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫After taking the keys off one of the slave traders, I returned to the carriage, "
"doing my best to act calm and suppress the bubbling exhilaration."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……俺は奴隷商から鍵を奪って、⟪k:3⟫馬車に戻った。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫湧き上がる昂ぶりをどうにか"
"抑えこんで、⟪k:6⟫平静を装っていた。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_22D704DB_3077_46C5_B94C_2FE52D04285E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1abfeeaeac43338f922dcb0660cf303e1dde6909b23aeabfab4fb353384ed584
#. default-sha256: 37cf28c99a5a269d9b2ef480ec99d043adf77b2ca48fe488f18d107708d47442
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_22D704DB_3077_46C5_B94C_2FE52D04285E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You.⟪k:2⟫"
