msgid "⟪k:0⟫Still, she would tell me when we met up how she wished she could help even more people."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それでも彼女は、⟪k:1⟫もっと多くの人を救えればいいのにと……俺に漏らすのだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_BB3DF870_0BA7_46FF_98A4_4D74F6E907FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
