msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_995AE10E_06EB_49DC_9F2C_EFDC0AD5B608"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫We’ll be turning the blood into a “miracle elixir,”⟪k:2⟫which she will then distribute "
"to patrons of the church—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫in exchange for tithes, of course."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫その奇跡の血を、⟪k:2⟫妙薬として教会で配るのだ。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫無論、⟪k:5⟫寄付は頂くがね。"

